[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……これは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...This is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだか霧がかってきた……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It's getting foggy all of a sudden...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "自然現象ではない。\n誰かいる。来るぞ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This isn't natural. Someone's here. They're coming."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "妖怪とやらは随分な小細工をきかせてくるんだな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So these spirits of yours are quite the tricksters."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ぜんぜん見えないわよ！\u3000どうするの！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I can't see anything! What do we do?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、でも霧が邪魔なら吹き飛ばしちゃえばいいのかな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, but if the fog's in the way, I can just blow it away!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "吹き飛ばす？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Blow it away?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これを使うのよ！\u3000それー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With this! Here goes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "乱暴だが、良い機転だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Crude, but good thinking."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アンペル",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Empel"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、姿を現せ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now show yourselves!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……まさか拙者の忍法「霧隠れの術」が\n破られるとは",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I never expected my Mist Concealment Technique to be broken so easily."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "何者だ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Who are you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それはこちらのセリフさ。\n君たちのことを教えてくれないか？\u3000それはもう色々と",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's my line. Why don't you tell us about yourselves? We have many questions for you."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんの目的でこの島に来たでござるか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You can start with your purpose for visiting this island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お前たちになんの関係がある？\nこの島の住人なのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's it to you? Are you residents of this island?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この島の住人でない貴様らに答える義理はありませぬ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We have no obligation to answer outsiders who don't belong on this island."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さあ、答えるのだ。貴様らは何者だ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now, answer us. Who are you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "特に白髪のおなご……普通の人間とは\n違う気を放っておると思っていたでござるが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Especially you, white-haired woman... you emanate an aura different from ordinary humans."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まさか妖怪ではあるまいな？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You wouldn't happen to be a spirit yourself, would you?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょーっと待ったー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hold on just a minute!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "確かにこの人たちも怪しいけど！\u3000あたしたちが\nよそ者なのは本当なんだからちゃんと説明しよう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sure, these guys are suspicious too, but they're not wrong. We really are outsiders, so let's break the ice first!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、怪しい……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "S-suspicious...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "？？？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "???"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "む……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほら、ケンカはやめて、話し合おう？\n仲良く、仲良ーく！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Come on, no more fighting! Let's talk this out, okay? Nicely and peacefully!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ふう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Fine."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私の名はリラ。そこの男はアンペルで、\nこいつはマルローネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My name is Lila. The man there is Empel, and this is Marie."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "最初から、すべて話そう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'll start from the beginning."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "リラ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Lila"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]